<title>USA: Monmouth Real Estate buys new building.</title>
<headline>Monmouth Real Estate buys new building.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monmouth Real Estate Investment Corp said on Thursday that it had bought a 148,000- square-foot industrial building in Fayetteville, North Carolina for $4.6 million.</p>
<p>Monmouth also said it assumed a $3.5 million first mortgage on the property, which is net leased to Belks Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>Monmouth Real Estate Investment Corp is a real estate investment trust with an equity portfolio consisting of fourteen industrial properties and one shopping center.</p>
